    "description": {
      "value": "<p>一個揹包可以容納一立方尺或30磅的裝備。你還可以將物品系在揹包外面，例如一卷鋪蓋或是一卷繩索。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>竊賊套組</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><em><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">Burglar</strong></em></span><span class=\"GramE\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><em><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">’</strong></em></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><em><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">s Pack</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:'Heiti SC Light'\"><em><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">（</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><em><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">16 </strong></em></span><span class=\"SpellE\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><em><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">gp</strong></em></span></span><span style=\"font-family:'Heiti SC Light'\"><em><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">）</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">。包括一個揹包、一包</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\">1000</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">粒的滾珠、</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺絃線、一個鈴鐺、五支蠟燭、一根撬棍、一把錘子、十支巖釘、</span><span class=\"GramE\"><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">一盞附蓋提燈</span></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">、兩支扁瓶燈油、五</span><span class=\"GramE\"><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">天份</span></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">口糧、一個火絨盒、和一個水袋。揹包外還掛着</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\">50</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺麻繩。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">(玩家人卡中刪除套裝，可以解壓縮套裝內容，本物品本身也是一個揹包，如果不把所有物品放在人物卡中，可以刪除套裝中得揹包物品。）</span></p>",
